  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The given curve is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math> which cuts the x-axis at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
